@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 管理员强制结束充电时序图

' 所有 SQL 操作使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，禁止字符串拼接
actor 管理员 as Admin
participant "Mock充电机\n(Swing 客户端)" as MC
participant "Flutter 客户端" as FE
participant "充电控制器" as Ctrl
participant "安全过滤器链" as Security
participant "充电服务" as Service
participant "计费服务" as Bill
database 数据库 as DB

Admin -> FE: 选择强制结束充电\n填写强制终止原因
FE -> Ctrl: HTTP POST /api/v1/charges/{id}/force-stop\n{reason: "设备异常发热"}
note right FE : ApiService.forceStop()\n请求自动附加 JWT Token\n仅管理员/最高管理者可调用\n必须使用 HTTPS 加密传输，防止凭证泄露

group 权限校验 [Spring Security Filter Chain]
  Ctrl -> Security: JwtAuthenticationFilter 解析 Token\n提取 principal (userId, role, scope)

  alt Token scope = mock_charger_only
    Security --> Ctrl: HTTP 403 Forbidden {error: "Mock 客户端无权强制结束充电"}
    Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 403 {error: "权限不足"}
    FE --> Admin: 提示"无权执行此操作"
    note right Security : Mock 客户端 scope=mock_charger_only\n禁止访问管理端功能
  else 正常用户 Token
    Security -> Security: @PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN') or hasRole('SUPER_ADMIN')")
  end
end

Ctrl -> Service: forceStop(recordId, reason)

Service -> DB: SELECT cr.*, c.status, c.type\nFROM charge_records cr\nJOIN chargers c ON cr.charger_id = c.id\nWHERE cr.id = ? FOR UPDATE -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，带行锁
DB --> Service: 充电记录、桩状态、桩类型

alt 记录状态为 processing（充电中）
  group 事务 [atomic] 覆盖: 结束记录 + 扣减余额 + 插入支付记录 + 释放桩 + 审计日志
    Service -> Bill: 计算充电量与费用\ncalculateFee(chargerType, energyKwh)
Bill --> Service: fee = calculated amount

    Service -> DB: SELECT balance FROM users WHERE id = ? FOR UPDATE -- 锁定用户行
    DB --> Service: 当前余额

    alt 余额充足
      Service -> DB: UPDATE users SET balance = balance - ?\nWHERE id = ? AND balance >= ?
      DB --> Service: 扣费成功

      Service -> DB: UPDATE charge_records SET end_time=now(),\nenergy_kwh=?, fee=?, status='completed',\ndeduction_status='paid' WHERE id = ? AND status='processing'
      DB --> Service: 记录更新成功

      Service -> DB: INSERT INTO payments (id, user_id, charge_record_id,\nmethod, amount, status)\nVALUES (?, ?, ?, 'system', ?, 'success')
      DB --> Service: 支付记录创建成功

      Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (actor_id, actor_type, action, resource, resource_id, payload)\nVALUES (?, 'admin', 'force_stop', 'charge_record', ?, ?::jsonb)
      note right DB : 强制结束充电审计日志\npayload 中记录强制终止原因\n如: {\"reason\": \"设备异常发热\"}\n仅在余额充足分支记录（避免与 force_stop_arrears 重复）
      DB --> Service: 审计日志记录成功
    else 余额不足
      Service -> DB: UPDATE charge_records SET end_time=now(),\nenergy_kwh=?, fee=?, status='completed',\ndeduction_status='arrears' WHERE id = ? AND status='processing'
      note right DB : 欠费标记：deduction_status = 'arrears'\n用户下次登录时提示补缴
      DB --> Service: 记录标记欠费

      Service -> DB: UPDATE users SET frozen_until = now() + INTERVAL '30 days' WHERE id = ? -- 欠费用户冻结30天
      note right DB : frozen_until 设置后该用户无法启动新充电\n充值后系统清除 frozen_until 解冻
      DB --> Service: 冻结设置成功

      Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (actor_id, actor_type, action, resource, resource_id, payload)\nVALUES (?, 'admin', 'force_stop_arrears', 'charge_record', ?, ?::jsonb)\npayload: {"reason": 强制终止原因, "deductionStatus": "arrears"}
      note right DB : 强制结束充电欠费审计日志\n与正常扣费分支的 force_stop 日志区分
      DB --> Service: 审计日志记录成功
    end

    Service -> DB: UPDATE chargers SET status = 'idle' WHERE id = ? AND status = 'charging'
    DB --> Service: 桩已释放
  end

  Service --> Ctrl: 强制结束成功
  Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 200 JSON {status: 'force_stopped', reason, fee, deductionStatus}
  FE -> MC: 推送强制结束通知\n{reason, fee, deductionStatus}
  MC -> MC: ChargerUIPanel 显示\n"强制结束充电\n原因: 设备异常发热"
  FE --> Admin: 显示"已强制结束充电，扣费完成/标记欠费"
else 记录状态不为 processing
  Service --> Ctrl: 该记录无需强制终止
  Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 409 Conflict {error: "记录状态不允许强制终止"}
  FE --> Admin: 显示"该充电记录无需强制终止"
end
@enduml